### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana",
  "lastname": "Souza",
  "email": "ana.souza@example.com",
  "password": "Senha@123",
  "cpf": "529.982.247-25",
  "birthdate": "1998-05-12",
  "gender": "FEMALE",
  "tel": "16999990001",
  "address": {
    "cep": "13560-001",
    "number": "100",
    "street": "Rua das Flores",
    "city": "São Carlos",
    "state": "SP"
  }
}

### Authenticate
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/authenticate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ana.souza@example.com",
  "password": "Senha@123"
}
